      "status": "open-confirmed-preexisting-BUG",
      "origin": "preexisting",
      "source_tag": "// BUG: [CR-FRAMEWORK-SCENE-0001] 段中允许 '/'，但文本形式用 '/' 连接；带斜杠的节点名经 as_str/parse 回读会变成不同层级。",
      "source_sha256": "d2e90edf5b894e9280b80424dead3488b8ae903f8167cd9e3c6aead418c468d6",
      "evidence": [
        "EntityPath::new accepts any nonempty/nonblank segment and joins it with slash without escaping.",
        "Input segments [a/b] form raw a/b, while EntityPath::parse(a/b) splits into two segments [a,b].",
        "World::path_segment_for_entity preserves a nonblank Name string, so a slash in a scene name can reach this text representation."
      ],
      "evidence_gap": null,
      "next_action": "Decide segment validation or escaping contract and add a roundtrip boundary fixture in separately authorized behavior work.",
      "bug_confirmed": true,
